            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Key Findings </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>- Discounts above 20% turn profit negative (Medium: -11.6K, High: -40.8K). </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>- The 80% discount causes the largest loss (-30.5K). 7 of the 10 worst products were sold at 80% discount (Binders and Appliances).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>- Furniture loses money at 30%-60% discounts. - In 2016, profit fell about 62% while sales stayed flat; the 80% discount loss tripled.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
